{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Skeletons (dangerous) are an ",["l","怪物","enemy"]," found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," after activating the ",["l","矿井#Shrine of Challenge","Shrine of Challenge"]," or during the ",["l","任务#Danger In The Deep","Danger In The Deep"]," quest. They can also be found in the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]," at any time. During the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],", they may spawn in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," if a certain ",["l","沙漠节#Skull Cavern","Calico Statue effect"]," is activated. 50 Skeletons (any type) need to be killed for the ",["l","探险家公会#Monster Eradication Goals","Monster Eradication Goal"]," at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],"."]]]],["Behavior",2,[["p",["They behave identically to their weaker counterpart the ",["l","骷髅","Skeleton"],". They approach and attack the player by collision, but also have a longer-ranged bone throw attack, which passes through rocks."]]]],["Strategy",2,[["p",["Simply hit them, and dodge any bones they throw."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can be found in ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],". Can spawn in ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," during ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]]]]]]]}